HAZOX TV

HAZOX TV is a modern web-based IPTV and media streaming platform designed with a clean Netflix-inspired user interface. The project focuses on providing a smooth and responsive viewing experience across desktop, laptop, tablet, and mobile devices.
Live Demo: https://alamhazrat108-beep.github.io/hazox-tv/
Features

- Modern Netflix-style dark theme
- Responsive design for all screen sizes
- IPTV playlist support
- Live TV player integration
- Channel search functionality
- Favorites management
- Full-screen video player
- Fast and lightweight interface
- Easy deployment on GitHub Pages
- Custom branding support

Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- HLS.js
- GitHub Pages

Project Vision

The goal of HAZOX TV is to create a modern entertainment platform that offers a professional user experience while remaining lightweight, accessible, and easy to customize.

Creator

